		{
			dependencies: ["3AAB0E864C590306"]
			description: ["The tower of The Night Lich is a large and forboding. While one may discover it naturally along their travels, an easier way of locating one would be to use Soul Stars, dropped from killing undead mobs. Do be aware, however, that you need 4 soul stars to place in each Chiseled Stone Alter, summoning the boss. Be careful."]
