		{
			dependencies: ["3CDD48DCA161A352"]
			description: ["Long guarded by the draugr that roam it, The Frosted Prison is a gargantuan structure housing the cursed soul of Maledictus. If you aim to conquer it and claim the Legendary Eye in his posession, then come prepared, less you meet a similar demise."]
