		{
			dependencies: ["4CE580B31A397745"]
			description: [
				"You will find the door to Maledictus's chamber guarded by powerful draugr known as &6&oAptgangr&r. These colossal foes are capable of sending shockwaves by slamming the ground with its axe, and charging at their enemies with a death grip."
				"If you manage to kill one, you will obtain the key to the Maledictus's chamber. Make your final preparations, for the time has nearly come."
			]
			id: "059DDAA627A824B9"
			tasks: [{
				id: "63C0EB56365D61B4"
				item: "cataclysm:strange_key"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Master Key"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["059DDAA627A824B9"]
			description: [
				"A difficult fight lies ahead of you to claim the Legendary Eye, for Maledictus can never truly be killed. Even so, his defeat at your hands will be all you need."
				"Maledictus is rageful, &6&ogetting stronger with each attack that hits its mark&r. At his rage's full potential, even simple strikes may become lethal to the unprepared. His mastery over &6close range maces, dexterous halberds, and long range bows&r will quickly become apparent. The bands around his arm indicate his attacks, with green being blockable, orange blockable but disabling shields, and red unblockable."
				"&6&oBe patient, be smart, and you will leave this room a champion.&r"
			]
			id: "67E1F1698D957610"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 200L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "5CEAC4CA80BC3B5A"
				ignore_reward_blocking: true
				type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				entity: "cataclysm:maledictus"
