		{
			dependencies: ["69BEEF688AA76D82"]
			description: ["It's hard to say who these ancient relics once belonged to, be it pirates or settlers, monsters or men. What's certainly the truth, however, is that these wrecks have valuable loot inside, including a &6&oBuried Treasure Map&r. This map will lead you to riches beyond your imagination, the most notable being the treasured &6&oHeart of The Sea&r, a rare item used as a crafting ingredient for numerous special items."]
